---
kind: lore
id: lore.palace
title: The drowned palace of Vael
series: palaceCodex
---

<entry id="codexStair" target="place.stair" category="codex" title="The flooded stair">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Four hundred steps down from the sea-gate. The first hundred are still carpeted.
</entry>

<entry id="codexHall" target="place.hall" category="codex" title="The long hall" when="holds('felled', ['eel'])">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: A hall the length of a ship, lit by windows that face nothing. Something long used to keep it.
</entry>

<entry id="codexChoir" target="place.choir" category="codex" title="The choir loft" when="holds('felled', ['choir'])">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The singers drowned mid-hymn. They have been finishing it ever since.
</entry>

<entry id="codexThrone" target="place.throne" category="codex" title="The throne of tides" when="holds('felled', ['regent'])">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The crown sits on the throne. Nobody sits under it. Not any more.
</entry>
